# `search.search`

Fan-out entity search across views, collections, agents, skills, sessions, and artifacts.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.search.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `q` | `string` |
| `kinds` | `string[]` |
| `limit` | `number` |
| `cursor` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`SearchResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `hits` | `map` |
| `next_cursor` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call search.search --json '{ "q": "", "kinds": [], "limit": 0, "cursor": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "hits": [
    {
      "kind": "ENTITY_KIND_COLLECTION_ITEM",
      "id": "note-checkout-notes",
      "label": "Checkout service notes",
      "path": "/collections/notes/note-checkout-notes",
      "icon": "file-text",
      "snippet": "Auth via JWT; idempotency key on POST /checkout.",
      "score": 0.95,
      "collection_id": "notes"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ENTITY_KIND_SKILL",
      "id": "run",
      "label": "run",
      "path": "/.ship/skills/run.md",
      "icon": "play",
      "snippet": "Launch and drive this project's app.",
      "score": 0.72
    }
  ],
  "next_cursor": ""
}
```
